md("""# andesim options: a field guide

Every `andesim run` option, one **demo** each, and the **error** you see when you get it wrong.

This is the *option reference*. For a guided tour of the three modes, see `andes_sim_tutorial.ipynb`; for the deeper write-ups see `USER_GUIDE.md` (linked per section below).

How to read a cell: each code cell is a real command (the outputs were captured on a live build, so you can read the notebook without running anything). Lines that start with `andesim run ...:` are driver errors (exit 2); `[info]` / `[andesim]` / `[hsim ...]` lines are progress; the last line(s) are the result. Long absolute paths in previews are shortened to `...`.""")

