```
andesim <command> [options] <ELF> [-- <engine args>]
```

Three commands, nothing hidden:

| command  | what it does                                      |
|----------|---------------------------------------------------|
| `run`    | run one simulation (the rest of this notebook)    |
| `list`   | show what is available (`models`, `engines`)      |
| `doctor` | check the toolchain + fixtures are present        |

The only option you must always give `run` is `--mode`. Everything after a bare `--` is handed to the underlying engine untouched (QEMU or vsim). Here is the full option list:""")

